{"seq":2,"slug":"state-management","title":"状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/state-management","wordCount":729,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"状态管理\">状态管理</h1><p>在 Jetpack Compose 中，UI 是状态的函数。状态管理决定了数据如何存储、流转和响应变化。正确的状态管理策略是构建可维护 Compose 应用的关键。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose 状态管理围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>mutableStateOf</code></strong>：可观察状态对象，值变化自动触发读取它的 Composable 重组，是状态的最小单元。</li>\n<li><strong><code>derivedStateOf</code></strong>：从其他状态派生计算结果，仅当依赖变化且派生结果也变化时才重组，适合&quot;输入频率高于输出频率&quot;的场景。</li>\n<li><strong><code>rememberSaveable</code></strong>：在 <code>remember</code> 之上增加持久化，跨配置变更和进程死亡恢复；复杂对象需提供自定义 Saver。</li>\n<li><strong>状态持有者（State Holder）/ ViewModel</strong>：状态逻辑变复杂时，按元素状态 → 组件状态 → 屏幕状态 → 应用状态逐级上移，分别由 <code>remember</code>、State Holder 类、ViewModel 承担。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选择哪个层级持有状态，是这套概念体系里最实用的判断。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"mutablestateof\">mutableStateOf</h2><p><code>mutableStateOf</code> 创建可观察的状态对象，当值变化时自动触发读取该值的 Composable 重组。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun LoginForm() {&#10;    var username by remember { mutableStateOf(&quot;&quot;) }&#10;    var password by remember { mutableStateOf(&quot;&quot;) }&#10;    var passwordVisible by remember { mutableStateOf(false) }&#10;&#10;    Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {&#10;        OutlinedTextField(&#10;            value = username,&#10;            onValueChange = { username = it },&#10;            label = { Text(&quot;用户名&quot;) },&#10;            modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()&#10;        )&#10;        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))&#10;        OutlinedTextField(&#10;            value = password,&#10;            onValueChange = { password = it },&#10;            label = { Text(&quot;密码&quot;) },&#10;            visualTransformation = if (passwordVisible) VisualTransformation.None&#10;                else PasswordVisualTransformation(),&#10;            trailingIcon = {&#10;                IconButton(onClick = { passwordVisible = !passwordVisible }) {&#10;                    Icon(&#10;                        imageVector = if (passwordVisible) Icons.Default.Visibility&#10;                            else Icons.Default.VisibilityOff,&#10;                        contentDescription = null&#10;                    )&#10;                }&#10;            },&#10;            modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun LoginForm() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var username by remember { mutableStateOf(\"\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var password by remember { mutableStateOf(\"\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var passwordVisible by remember { mutableStateOf(false) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Column(modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        OutlinedTextField(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            value = username,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onValueChange = { username = it },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            label = { Text(\"用户名\") },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Spacer(modifier = Modifier.height(8.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        OutlinedTextField(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            value = password,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onValueChange = { password = it },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            label = { Text(\"密码\") },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            visualTransformation = if (passwordVisible) VisualTransformation.None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                else PasswordVisualTransformation(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            trailingIcon = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                IconButton(onClick = { passwordVisible = !passwordVisible }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    Icon(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        imageVector = if (passwordVisible) Icons.Default.Visibility</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            else Icons.Default.VisibilityOff,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        contentDescription = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>State 的三种声明方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>解构声明</td>\n<td><code>val (value, setValue) = remember { mutableStateOf(&quot;&quot;) }</code></td>\n<td>明确区分读写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>by</code> 委托</td>\n<td><code>var value by remember { mutableStateOf(&quot;&quot;) }</code></td>\n<td>简洁，直接读写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接引用</td>\n<td><code>val state = remember { mutableStateOf(&quot;&quot;) }</code></td>\n<td>需要 <code>.value</code> 访问</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 对于基本类型（Int、Long、Float、Double），使用专门的 <code>mutableIntStateOf</code>、<code>mutableLongStateOf</code> 等函数，避免自动装箱带来的性能开销。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"derivedstateof\">derivedStateOf</h2><p><code>derivedStateOf</code> 用于从其他状态派生计算结果，仅当依赖的状态变化且派生结果也变化时才触发重组。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun FilteredProductList(products: List&lt;Product&gt;) {&#10;    var searchQuery by remember { mutableStateOf(&quot;&quot;) }&#10;    var selectedCategory by remember { mutableStateOf&lt;Category?&gt;(null) }&#10;&#10;    val filteredProducts by remember(products) {&#10;        derivedStateOf {&#10;            products.filter { product -&gt;&#10;                (searchQuery.isBlank() || product.name.contains(searchQuery, ignoreCase = true)) &amp;&amp;&#10;                (selectedCategory == null || product.category == selectedCategory)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    val resultSummary by remember {&#10;        derivedStateOf {&#10;            &quot;${filteredProducts.size} 个结果&quot;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    Column {&#10;        SearchBar(query = searchQuery, onQueryChange = { searchQuery = it })&#10;        Text(text = resultSummary, modifier = Modifier.padding(8.dp))&#10;        LazyColumn {&#10;            items(filteredProducts, key = { it.id }) { product -&gt;&#10;                ProductItem(product = product)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun FilteredProductList(products: List&#x3C;Product>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var searchQuery by remember { mutableStateOf(\"\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var selectedCategory by remember { mutableStateOf&#x3C;Category?>(null) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val filteredProducts by remember(products) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        derivedStateOf {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            products.filter { product -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                (searchQuery.isBlank() || product.name.contains(searchQuery, ignoreCase = true)) &#x26;&#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                (selectedCategory == null || product.category == selectedCategory)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val resultSummary by remember {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        derivedStateOf {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"${filteredProducts.size} 个结果\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Column {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SearchBar(query = searchQuery, onQueryChange = { searchQuery = it })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Text(text = resultSummary, modifier = Modifier.padding(8.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        LazyColumn {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            items(filteredProducts, key = { it.id }) { product -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ProductItem(product = product)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[searchQuery 变化] --&gt; C[derivedStateOf 重新计算]&#10;    B[selectedCategory 变化] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D{filteredProducts 结果是否变化?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[触发 UI 重组]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[跳过重组]&#10;&#10;    classDef triggerStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A,B triggerStyle\">graph LR\n    A[searchQuery 变化] --&gt; C[derivedStateOf 重新计算]\n    B[selectedCategory 变化] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D{filteredProducts 结果是否变化?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[触发 UI 重组]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[跳过重组]\n\n    classDef triggerStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A,B triggerStyle</pre><p><code>derivedStateOf</code> 适用于输入变化频率高于输出变化频率的场景，如从快速变化的滚动位置派生&quot;是否显示回到顶部按钮&quot;。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"remembersaveable\">rememberSaveable</h2><p><code>rememberSaveable</code> 在 <code>remember</code> 的基础上增加了状态持久化能力，支持配置变更（如屏幕旋转）和进程死亡后的状态恢复。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun ArticleEditor() {&#10;    var title by rememberSaveable { mutableStateOf(&quot;&quot;) }&#10;    var content by rememberSaveable { mutableStateOf(&quot;&quot;) }&#10;    var selectedTab by rememberSaveable { mutableIntStateOf(0) }&#10;&#10;    Column {&#10;        TabRow(selectedTabIndex = selectedTab) {&#10;            Tab(selected = selectedTab == 0, onClick = { selectedTab = 0 }) {&#10;                Text(&quot;编辑&quot;, modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp))&#10;            }&#10;            Tab(selected = selectedTab == 1, onClick = { selectedTab = 1 }) {&#10;                Text(&quot;预览&quot;, modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp))&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;        when (selectedTab) {&#10;            0 -&gt; EditorPane(title, content, { title = it }, { content = it })&#10;            1 -&gt; PreviewPane(title, content)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ArticleEditor() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var title by rememberSaveable { mutableStateOf(\"\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var content by rememberSaveable { mutableStateOf(\"\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var selectedTab by rememberSaveable { mutableIntStateOf(0) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Column {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        TabRow(selectedTabIndex = selectedTab) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Tab(selected = selectedTab == 0, onClick = { selectedTab = 0 }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(\"编辑\", modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Tab(selected = selectedTab == 1, onClick = { selectedTab = 1 }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                Text(\"预览\", modifier = Modifier.padding(16.dp))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        when (selectedTab) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            0 -> EditorPane(title, content, { title = it }, { content = it })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            1 -> PreviewPane(title, content)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于复杂对象，需要提供自定义 Saver：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"data class SearchFilter(&#10;    val query: String,&#10;    val category: String,&#10;    val minPrice: Double,&#10;    val maxPrice: Double&#10;)&#10;&#10;val SearchFilterSaver = run {&#10;    val queryKey = &quot;query&quot;&#10;    val categoryKey = &quot;category&quot;&#10;    val minPriceKey = &quot;minPrice&quot;&#10;    val maxPriceKey = &quot;maxPrice&quot;&#10;&#10;    mapSaver(&#10;        save = { filter -&gt;&#10;            mapOf(&#10;                queryKey to filter.query,&#10;                categoryKey to filter.category,&#10;                minPriceKey to filter.minPrice,&#10;                maxPriceKey to filter.maxPrice&#10;            )&#10;        },&#10;        restore = { map -&gt;&#10;            SearchFilter(&#10;                query = map[queryKey] as String,&#10;                category = map[categoryKey] as String,&#10;                minPrice = map[minPriceKey] as Double,&#10;                maxPrice = map[maxPriceKey] as Double&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    )&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun FilterScreen() {&#10;    var filter by rememberSaveable(stateSaver = SearchFilterSaver) {&#10;        mutableStateOf(SearchFilter(&quot;&quot;, &quot;全部&quot;, 0.0, 1000.0))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data class SearchFilter(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val query: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val category: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val minPrice: Double,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val maxPrice: Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val SearchFilterSaver = run {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val queryKey = \"query\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val categoryKey = \"category\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val minPriceKey = \"minPrice\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val maxPriceKey = \"maxPrice\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mapSaver(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        save = { filter -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            mapOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                queryKey to filter.query,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                categoryKey to filter.category,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                minPriceKey to filter.minPrice,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                maxPriceKey to filter.maxPrice</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        restore = { map -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            SearchFilter(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                query = map[queryKey] as String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                category = map[categoryKey] as String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                minPrice = map[minPriceKey] as Double,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                maxPrice = map[maxPriceKey] as Double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun FilterScreen() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var filter by rememberSaveable(stateSaver = SearchFilterSaver) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        mutableStateOf(SearchFilter(\"\", \"全部\", 0.0, 1000.0))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"状态持有者-state-holder\">状态持有者（State Holder）</h2><p>当组件状态逻辑变得复杂时，应将状态提取到专门的状态持有者类中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class DrawerState(&#10;    initialOpen: Boolean = false&#10;) {&#10;    var isOpen by mutableStateOf(initialOpen)&#10;        private set&#10;&#10;    var selectedItem by mutableStateOf&lt;MenuItem?&gt;(null)&#10;        private set&#10;&#10;    fun open() { isOpen = true }&#10;    fun close() { isOpen = false }&#10;    fun toggle() { isOpen = !isOpen }&#10;    fun selectItem(item: MenuItem) { selectedItem = item }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun rememberDrawerState(initialOpen: Boolean = false): DrawerState {&#10;    return remember { DrawerState(initialOpen) }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun AppScaffold() {&#10;    val drawerState = rememberDrawerState()&#10;&#10;    ModalNavigationDrawer(&#10;        drawerState = rememberDrawerState(),&#10;        drawerContent = {&#10;            DrawerContent(&#10;                selectedItem = drawerState.selectedItem,&#10;                onItemSelected = { drawerState.selectItem(it) }&#10;            )&#10;        }&#10;    ) {&#10;        MainContent(onMenuClick = { drawerState.toggle() })&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class DrawerState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    initialOpen: Boolean = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var isOpen by mutableStateOf(initialOpen)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        private set</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var selectedItem by mutableStateOf&#x3C;MenuItem?>(null)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        private set</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun open() { isOpen = true }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun close() { isOpen = false }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun toggle() { isOpen = !isOpen }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun selectItem(item: MenuItem) { selectedItem = item }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun rememberDrawerState(initialOpen: Boolean = false): DrawerState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return remember { DrawerState(initialOpen) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AppScaffold() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val drawerState = rememberDrawerState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ModalNavigationDrawer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        drawerState = rememberDrawerState(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        drawerContent = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            DrawerContent(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                selectedItem = drawerState.selectedItem,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onItemSelected = { drawerState.selectItem(it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        MainContent(onMenuClick = { drawerState.toggle() })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[UI 复杂度] --&gt; B{状态逻辑复杂?}&#10;    B --&gt;|简单| C[&quot;remember + mutableStateOf&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|中等| D[State Holder 类]&#10;    B --&gt;|复杂/跨屏幕| E[ViewModel]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; F[局部 UI 状态]&#10;    D --&gt; G[组件级状态逻辑]&#10;    E --&gt; H[业务逻辑 + 数据层]&#10;&#10;    classDef simpleStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    classDef mediumStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    classDef complexStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class C simpleStyle&#10;    class D mediumStyle&#10;    class E complexStyle\">graph TD\n    A[UI 复杂度] --&gt; B{状态逻辑复杂?}\n    B --&gt;|简单| C[\"remember + mutableStateOf\"]\n    B --&gt;|中等| D[State Holder 类]\n    B --&gt;|复杂/跨屏幕| E[ViewModel]\n\n    C --&gt; F[局部 UI 状态]\n    D --&gt; G[组件级状态逻辑]\n    E --&gt; H[业务逻辑 + 数据层]\n\n    classDef simpleStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef mediumStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef complexStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class C simpleStyle\n    class D mediumStyle\n    class E complexStyle</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"viewmodel-集成\">ViewModel 集成</h2><p>ViewModel 持有屏幕级别的业务状态，通过 <code>hiltViewModel()</code> 或 <code>viewModel()</code> 在 Composable 中获取。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@HiltViewModel&#10;class ProductListViewModel @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val repository: ProductRepository&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow(ProductListUiState())&#10;    val uiState = _uiState.asStateFlow()&#10;&#10;    init {&#10;        loadProducts()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun loadProducts() {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            _uiState.update { it.copy(isLoading = true) }&#10;            repository.getProducts()&#10;                .onSuccess { products -&gt;&#10;                    _uiState.update { it.copy(products = products, isLoading = false) }&#10;                }&#10;                .onFailure { error -&gt;&#10;                    _uiState.update { it.copy(error = error.message, isLoading = false) }&#10;                }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun refresh() = loadProducts()&#10;}&#10;&#10;data class ProductListUiState(&#10;    val products: List&lt;Product&gt; = emptyList(),&#10;    val isLoading: Boolean = false,&#10;    val error: String? = null&#10;)&#10;&#10;@Composable&#10;fun ProductListScreen(viewModel: ProductListViewModel = hiltViewModel()) {&#10;    val uiState by viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()&#10;&#10;    when {&#10;        uiState.isLoading -&gt; LoadingIndicator()&#10;        uiState.error != null -&gt; ErrorMessage(&#10;            message = uiState.error!!,&#10;            onRetry = viewModel::refresh&#10;        )&#10;        else -&gt; ProductList(products = uiState.products)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ProductListViewModel @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository: ProductRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow(ProductListUiState())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val uiState = _uiState.asStateFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    init {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loadProducts()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loadProducts() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _uiState.update { it.copy(isLoading = true) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repository.getProducts()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .onSuccess { products -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    _uiState.update { it.copy(products = products, isLoading = false) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .onFailure { error -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    _uiState.update { it.copy(error = error.message, isLoading = false) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun refresh() = loadProducts()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class ProductListUiState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val products: List&#x3C;Product> = emptyList(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val isLoading: Boolean = false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val error: String? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun ProductListScreen(viewModel: ProductListViewModel = hiltViewModel()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val uiState by viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    when {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uiState.isLoading -> LoadingIndicator()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        uiState.error != null -> ErrorMessage(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            message = uiState.error!!,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onRetry = viewModel::refresh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        else -> ProductList(products = uiState.products)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态层级</th>\n<th>持有者</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>元素状态</td>\n<td><code>remember</code></td>\n<td>动画、焦点、展开/折叠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件状态</td>\n<td>State Holder</td>\n<td>复杂 UI 组件逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屏幕状态</td>\n<td>ViewModel</td>\n<td>业务逻辑、数据加载、跨配置变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>应用状态</td>\n<td>ViewModel + Repository</td>\n<td>全局设置、用户认证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>collectAsStateWithLifecycle()</code> 替代 <code>collectAsState()</code>，它会在 Lifecycle 处于非活跃状态时自动停止收集，避免不必要的资源消耗。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>mutableStateOf</code> 创建可观察状态，值变化自动触发重组</li>\n<li><code>derivedStateOf</code> 从其他状态派生值，避免不必要的重组</li>\n<li><code>rememberSaveable</code> 支持跨配置变更和进程死亡的状态恢复</li>\n<li>状态持有者类封装复杂的 UI 状态逻辑，保持 Composable 简洁</li>\n<li>ViewModel 管理屏幕级业务状态，通过 <code>collectAsStateWithLifecycle()</code> 与 Compose 集成</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"状态管理","id":"状态管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"mutableStateOf","id":"mutablestateof"},{"level":2,"text":"derivedStateOf","id":"derivedstateof"},{"level":2,"text":"rememberSaveable","id":"remembersaveable"},{"level":2,"text":"状态持有者（State Holder）","id":"状态持有者-state-holder"},{"level":2,"text":"ViewModel 集成","id":"viewmodel-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Compose 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/compose-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"布局与修饰符","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/layout-and-modifiers"}}